> > > > > > > > > > > > > - Try a simpler model without the regressions, to see whether the problem remains.
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > - In my experience, if you need more than 500 burnin iterations, these models will never converge.
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > - For lines like
